      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-6fa001579ed2"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q1:snap:https://zyrm.zyjjw.cn/xiaofei/202607/157453.html:23",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://zyrm.zyjjw.cn/xiaofei/202607/157453.html",
      "quote": "大众服饰市场呈现出K型分化，高端市场被国际品牌与头部奢侈品牌垄断，低端市场被极致性价比的白牌、电商产业带品牌疯狂蚕食，中端休闲服饰处于“上不去、下不来”的夹层困境之中。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-6fa001579ed2"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q1:snap:https://zyrm.zyjjw.cn/xiaofei/202607/157453.html:24",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://zyrm.zyjjw.cn/xiaofei/202607/157453.html",
      "quote": "从森马自身看，则存在阶段性阵痛：一是品牌形象老化……二是产品创新不足",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-6fa001579ed2"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q1:snap:https://zyrm.zyjjw.cn/xiaofei/202607/157453.html:25",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://zyrm.zyjjw.cn/xiaofei/202607/157453.html",
      "quote": "森马现阶段的全年龄客群定位容易陷入“泛而不精”，如何在普适性中打造差异化记忆点，打动不同年龄段消费者，是产品端的核心命题；同时，传统渠道效能下滑",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-6fa001579ed2"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q1:snap:https://zyrm.zyjjw.cn/xiaofei/202607/157453.html:26",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://zyrm.zyjjw.cn/xiaofei/202607/157453.html",
      "quote": "想要完成转型需要牺牲短期利润，但品牌往往很难做出这类取舍；同时消费者心智一旦固化很难扭转",
