      "versionId": "sv-9d71e3c3c2a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q3:snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952:2",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952",
      "quote": "虽然上海首映礼24日晚才举行，但23日，荷兰弟夫妇已经从上一站墨西哥赶到了中国，没来得及倒时差，就低调出门逛街了。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-9d71e3c3c2a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q3:snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952:3",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952",
      "quote": "荷兰弟早上穿着衬衫长裤就出门了，赞达亚也穿着长袖长裤，结果直接被热到了！中午时分，网友就发现赞达亚脱掉了外套，荷兰弟则中途直接冲进了森马，买了一条牛仔短裤，并当场换上。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-9d71e3c3c2a3"
    },
    {
