      "quote": "而这条引发全网关注的新裤子经确认就是一条标价239元（折后159元）的森马牛仔短裤。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-9d71e3c3c2a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q3:snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952:5",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952",
      "quote": "同一天，荷兰弟穿的可是Prada的鞋和Acne Studios的衬衫。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-9d71e3c3c2a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q3:snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952:6",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952",
      "quote": "23日当晚，森马旗舰店的淘宝直播间冲到男装榜榜首，森马在抖音平台的几个直播间也迎来数万人观看，部分直播间GMV较前日翻了数倍。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-9d71e3c3c2a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q3:snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952:7",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952",
      "quote": "荷兰弟同款裤子同色全尺码售罄，预售排至“8月8日前发货”。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-9d71e3c3c2a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q3:snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952:8",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952",
      "quote": "其全年营收150.90亿元，同比增长3.17%；归属上市公司股东的净利润降至8.92亿元，同比下滑21.54%。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-9d71e3c3c2a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q3:snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952:9",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952",
      "quote": "数据显示，森马旗下童装业务撑起了超过7成的营收，除自有品牌巴拉巴拉外其还拥有亚瑟士儿童与彪马儿童的代理权。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-9d71e3c3c2a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q3:snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952:10",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952",
      "quote": "截至2025年末，森马服饰拥有2676家休闲服饰门店，较年初减少135家。若按公司全部品牌计算，森马服饰共有7931家线下门店，其中直营店1028家、加盟店6872家、联营店31家。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-9d71e3c3c2a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q3:snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952:11",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952",
      "quote": "2025年，该公司直营渠道收入同比增长30.25%。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-9d71e3c3c2a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q3:snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952:12",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://so.html5.qq.com/page/real/search_news?docid=70000021_6836a6466e762952",
      "quote": "诞生于上世纪90年代的森马，曾是家喻户晓的“步行街之王”。黄金时期，其请来谢霆锋做代言人，跟隔壁周杰伦代言的美特斯邦威对打擂台各放异彩。2011年，森马服饰上市，五年后营收突破百亿。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-9d71e3c3c2a3"
    },
