    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:0",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "森马服饰2025年总营收150.90亿元，其中儿童服饰业务收入达108.00亿元，同比增长5.18%，占总营收比重攀升至71.57%；而曾经的立身之本成人休闲服饰，全年营收仅40.55亿元，同比下滑3.22%，占比仅26.87%。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:1",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "截至2025年末，旗下童装品牌巴拉巴拉线下门店数量已达5255家，从一二线城市购物中心到县城核心步行街随处可见。而森马成人服装门店仅剩2676家，同样不足童装门店数的一半。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:2",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "凭借百亿级营收规模，巴拉巴拉成为国内童装行业首个百亿平台，甚至被欧睿国际连续多年评定为\"全亚洲第一童装品牌\"。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:3",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "2025年上半年其营收仅2.27亿元，同比大跌45.23%，门店数量从巅峰期的5500余家缩减至600余家，即便创始人重新出山也未能止住颓势。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:4",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "另一家本土休闲服饰品牌太平鸟，2025年上半年营收同样下滑7.86%，成人服装业务增长乏力。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:5",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "2018年，森马童装业务营收首次超过成人服装，正式成为集团第一大业务，此后两者差距持续拉大。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:6",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "2022年9月，森马正式推出高端子品牌balabala premium，定位5-12岁儿童全场景高端服饰，定价为巴拉巴拉主品牌的2-3倍。2023年1月，该品牌首店落地广州天汇广场IGC。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:7",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "为此，森马先后拿下亚瑟士儿童中国大陆独家运营授权、彪马儿童童鞋品类中国大陆经销权，借国际成熟品牌的势能快速切入市场。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:8",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "截至2024年底，巴拉巴拉已进驻全球25个国家和地区，开设约100家门店，当年海外业务同比增长40%，增速远超国内市场。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:9",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "2026年5月，巴拉巴拉欧洲首店落地意大利罗马，以时尚之都为切入点辐射欧洲市场。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:10",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "2024年底，安踏儿童宣布年流水突破100亿元，成为运动行业首个百亿儿童品牌……截至2025年末，安踏儿童门店数量约2652家，仅为森马童装门店数的一半左右。粗略计算，安踏儿童单店年营收约377万元",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:11",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "中高端市场由FILAKIDS坐镇，截至2025年门店达578家，主打时尚运动风格，客单价远超巴拉巴拉",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:12",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "李宁旗下李宁young门店已达1518家，网点增速超过主品牌",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:13",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "特步聚焦儿童跑步垂直赛道，与清华大学合作采集33万组儿童足部数据，推出\"成长鞋\"技术体系，特步少年门店数量已达1488家",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:14",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "361度儿童业务收入占比已超20%，被集团列为核心增长引擎",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:15",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "粗略计算，安踏儿童单店年营收约377万元，而巴拉巴拉单店年营收约205万元，前者单店产出接近后者的1.8倍",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:16",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "2010年后，ZARA、优衣库等国际快时尚品牌加速入华，叠加电商渠道冲击，本土休闲服饰集体陷入同质化竞争、库存高企、品牌老化的困局",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:17",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "森马的国际化布局起步于2014年，先是以加盟模式进入沙特、阿联酋等中东市场",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:18",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "产品端先后与华裔设计师Jason Wu、Dior Homme前艺术总监Kris Van Assche推出联名系列，主打高端功能面料与场景化设计",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100:19",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260727A06WH100",
      "quote": "7月23日，有网友在上海偶遇美国演员\"荷兰弟\"汤姆·赫兰德，发现其在逛街时手提森马购物袋，身着森马牛仔短裤。这个几乎被大众遗忘的休闲品牌，久违地冲上热搜。一天之内，同款水洗黑短裤在线上线下各大平台都被抢到了\"售罄\"状态。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-f5fafa7ebd06"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147:0",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147",
      "quote": "2023年，森马“二代”邱坚强成为公司董事长，森马随之启动品牌转型。早年扬言要做“中国版ZARA”的目标被放弃，转而开始向优衣库学习，将目标客群从此前的“95后新青年”改为“中国大众家庭”。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-7735518a4250"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147:1",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147",
      "quote": "森马第三季度实现营业收入为36.95亿元，同比增长7.31%。净利润2.12亿元，同比增加4.55%；扣非净利润为2.19亿元，同比增长13.11%",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-7735518a4250"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147:2",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147",
      "quote": "2025年1-9月份，森马实现营业总收入98.44亿元，同比增加4.74%；净利润5.37亿元，同比下降28.9%；扣非后净利润5.15亿元，同比下滑29.83%，核心盈利能力减弱。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-7735518a4250"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147:3",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147",
      "quote": "年初至报告期末经营活动产生的现金流量净额为-4.85亿元。核心原因是本期支付的货款大幅增加，而销售商品收到的现金同比仅增长4.09%，收支匹配度不佳。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-7735518a4250"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147:4",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147",
      "quote": "截至2025年第三季度，森马门店数为8105家。其中，成人装门店2752家，童装门店5353家。按照经营类型分，直营店1027家，加盟店7046家，联营32家",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-7735518a4250"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147:5",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147",
      "quote": "2025年前三季度，森马包括直营与加盟、线上与线下在内的全渠道整体零售增长6.29%，其中，线上增长2.92%，线下增长7.9%。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-7735518a4250"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147:6",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147",
      "quote": "渠道优化后作用在品牌身上得到的成果是，巴拉巴拉、森马品牌零售额分别同比增长5.34%和2.72%。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-7735518a4250"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147:7",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147",
      "quote": "2025年前三季度，公司的销售费用、管理费用、研发费用合计费用34.37亿元，同比增长14.13%。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-7735518a4250"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147:8",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147",
      "quote": "据华源证券报道，2025年上半年，森马儿童服饰的毛利率为48.21%，休闲服饰为43.22%。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-7735518a4250"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147:9",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147",
      "quote": "当年，巴拉巴拉品牌营收首次超过森马主品牌，营收占比在2017年就已超过5成，公司自此开启了以童装为核心的战略转型。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-7735518a4250"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147:10",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147",
      "quote": "2024年以及2025年上半年，公司童装业务收入稳定在七成以上，森马服饰随之从“休闲服饰公司”转变为“儿童服饰公司”。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-7735518a4250"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147:11",
      "snapshotId": "snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147",
      "quote": "通过集中采购、规模化生产、全球分仓物流，将库存周转天数控制在90天左右，远低于行业平均水平。",
      "revision": 1,
      "extractionCheck": "UNCHECKED",
      "versionId": "sv-7735518a4250"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev:q4:snap:https://m.sohu.com/a/953962835_250147:12",
